## File 4: `.gitignore`

**Create this file in your `scraper` folder:**
```
# Dependencies
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Build files
dist/
build/
```

